{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "digiutils",
 "version": "1.9a",
 "title": "Digi utilities",
 "description": "Digi utilities: hold the \"...\" key to open a live utility page over the main screen: waveform, spectrum analyser, stereo X-Y, then closes; tuner and activity dots for all 8 tracks. YES: fullscreen, NO closes; the knobs keep editing the sound underneath. Song mode works as stock (tap \"...\"). The master EQ has moved to its own mod, Digi EQ.",
 "category": "Utilities",
 "author": "gdeo607",
 "license": "",
